{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 5254, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 3491, "text": "Okay, Thursday's out.\nHow about Friday?"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 7292, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 5427, "text": "Can't. I'm going to the basketball game."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 10022, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 7462, "text": "- Saturday?\n- I got hockey tickets."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 13190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10198, "text": "And I guess Sunday\nit's synchronized swimming in Newark."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 16804, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 13368, "text": "As a matter of fact,\nI'm kind of free on Sunday."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 21272, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 16972, "text": "- But I'd really love to go to that Jets game.\n- Then it's a date."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 24839, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 21676, "text": "You mean, you got tickets?\nBut it's been sold out for two weeks."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 28141, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25013, "text": "I'll get them. I got the sources."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 32946, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28316, "text": "Then afterwards,\nwe go up to my place, we light a fire..."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 36950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33822, "text": "...and we'll roast things."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 38821, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 37559, "text": "Sounds perfect."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 40791, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 38994, "text": "It's gonna be close."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 43156, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 41529, "text": "See you later."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 45231, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 43331, "text": "Ciao, baby."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 49899, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 46668, "text": "Hey, how about a shave, my treat."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 60309, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 58079, "text": "Selma, this is Andy. He's my son."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 61949, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 60482, "text": "- Hi.\n- Hi."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 63414, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 62117, "text": "Bye now."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 66247, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 63585, "text": "- Take care.\n- See you."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 70619, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 66421, "text": "I didn't hear that. I didn't see that.\nIt didn't happen."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 73691, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 71860, "text": "Hey, Mac, I'd like you to meet Andy."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 75489, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 73862, "text": "- He's my son.\n- Hi, Mac."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 77959, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 75764, "text": "Oh, get out of here, you got a kid."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 81032, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 79167, "text": "How come I haven't seen him\nbefore today?"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 83534, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 81202, "text": "I haven't seen him before today myself."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 87402, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 83705, "text": "Oh, I get it. A blast from the past, huh?"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 91736, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 90712, "text": "- Hey, guys.\n- Hi."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 93141, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 91913, "text": "Hey, Harry."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 95043, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 93314, "text": "- Who's that?\n- Guess."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 98674, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 95216, "text": "Well, offhand,\nI'd go with a small human."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 104390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 101489, "text": "Every time he does that, I get chills."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 106959, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 104559, "text": "- Your Honor, I'd like you to meet Andy.\n- Hi."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 109119, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 107128, "text": "- Hi.\n- The Volunteer Fathers' Organization..."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 110491, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 109297, "text": "...just gave him to me."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 112064, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 110665, "text": "So, what are you guys up to?"}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 115760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 112233, "text": "We just played basketball.\nBeat nine guys in the park."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 120374, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 115937, "text": "It was easy.\nFeed Bull, stuff, feed Bull, stuff."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 122169, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 120542, "text": "We got quite a team here, people."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 124373, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 122610, "text": "Can I see your courtroom now, Bull?"}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 128648, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 125747, "text": "I kind of told him I ran things."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 130681, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 129350, "text": "Well, you kind of do."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 134044, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 131052, "text": "Listen, if no one's around,\nis it okay if we bang your gavel?"}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 135849, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 134222, "text": "- Have a ball.\n- Thanks, Harry."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 140220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 138059, "text": "Hit the flight deck."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 148799, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 145500, "text": "Hey, Bull, if I were you,\nI'd think about having that growth removed."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 153501, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 151806, "text": "You must be Fielding."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 155506, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 153675, "text": "My reputation precedes me, huh?"}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 157645, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 155677, "text": "So does your nose."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 163574, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 161549, "text": "Listen, punk, don't you ever..."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 168184, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 164953, "text": "...change. You're marvelous.\nI love you. Get out of here."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 173857, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 171559, "text": "Do you know what you are?"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 176993, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 174729, "text": "Alive."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 234821, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 230919, "text": "Boy, I'll tell you, Mac, that is one heck\nof a sweater you got on today."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 236923, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 234989, "text": "I'm not giving up my tickets, Dan."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 239826, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 237358, "text": "- Please.\n- Dan, don't beg."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 241359, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 239994, "text": "I don't mind."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 244327, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 241529, "text": "I told you, no.\nI wanna go to the game myself."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 247935, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 244499, "text": "I'm taking my grandfather, who's been\nlooking forward to this a long time."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 251731, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 248102, "text": "Your grandfather? He's almost 80 years old.\nOne exciting play could kill him."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 253601, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 251906, "text": "Dan, no."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 258243, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254375, "text": "Fine, go ahead, play God."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 261805, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 259314, "text": "Whoa, these are neat binoculars."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 264679, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 261983, "text": "I use them to check out cheerleaders\nwhen I'm at ball games."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 266479, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 264852, "text": "Use what?"}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 269555, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 266654, "text": "Excuse us, will you, Selma?\nThis is guy talk."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 271157, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 269724, "text": "So sorry."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 274955, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 271326, "text": "Let me go hang myself in the toilet."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 279127, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 275964, "text": "Next case, Your Honor. Arthur Hubble.\nAssault and battery."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 282535, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 280101, "text": "Hi there, Mr. Hubble. Are you okay?"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 284831, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 282704, "text": "I hate Central Park in autumn."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 287440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 285006, "text": "I hate the UN Building. I hate bridges."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 291704, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 288576, "text": "It says here you're an employee\nof the City Tourism Bureau."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 294006, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 291879, "text": "I hate New York."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 298016, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 294182, "text": "Your Honor, Mr. Hubble was on his way\nto a seminar on subway hospitality..."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 300051, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 298186, "text": "...when he was mugged outside city hall."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 302917, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 300221, "text": "They took everything.\nMy wallet, my keys, my cash."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 306151, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 303091, "text": "And after pleading\nwith several passersby for bus fare..."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 309626, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306327, "text": "...Mr. Hubble attempted to panhandle\nfrom a group of Japanese tourists."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 311321, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 309797, "text": "- They turned him down.\n- And?"}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 313194, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 311499, "text": "He mugged them."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 316098, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 314369, "text": "The State wishes to submit evidence."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 319069, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 316271, "text": "We have affidavits from the victims,\nsome shredded yen..."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 323472, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 319240, "text": "...and over 70 action-packed photographs\nof the incident."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 325674, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323945, "text": "I hate tourists."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 328281, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 325847, "text": "Isn't that a little inconsistent\nwith your job?"}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 330508, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 328449, "text": "- I hate my job.\n- Got it."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 332585, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 330685, "text": "I hate you."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 337088, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 332754, "text": "Well, I saw that one coming.\nIt'll be 10 days, and a $500 fine."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 338550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 337492, "text": "Have a nice day."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 343228, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 340828, "text": "It's chow time, people."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 349626, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 348136, "text": "Hi, Bull."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 352295, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 349804, "text": "- Started the math homework?\n- I'm on the last page."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 355432, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 353908, "text": "They only gave you one page."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 359643, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 355843, "text": "- How'd you know?\n- I know everything."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 361539, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 360515, "text": "Now hit it."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 364584, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 362150, "text": "- Thanks for yelling at me, Bull.\n- I wasn't yelling."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 367778, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 364752, "text": "Hey, it's okay.\nIt feels good to have a father tell me..."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 370520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 368256, "text": "I mean, to have you tell me what to do."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 372319, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 370692, "text": "- I miss that.\n- Really?"}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 374392, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 373027, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 376760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 375463, "text": "Bull..."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 379357, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 377765, "text": "...I wish you were my father."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 381965, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380668, "text": "Yeah, well..."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 384104, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 382136, "text": "Move your butt\nand get a jump on that math."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 386934, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 384272, "text": "\"Move your butt.\"\nNobody ever said that to me before."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 391277, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 388376, "text": "Of course, nobody ever lifted a Volvo\nfor me before either."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 396310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 393147, "text": "What do you mean you can't get me\na pair, Norm? You're a scalper."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 399715, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 396484, "text": "Wait, you know what? I read in the paper\nthat the owner of the team..."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 404051, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 399887, "text": "...every week, sends an allotment of tickets\nover to this orphans' home in Queens."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 407194, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 404225, "text": "Maybe you could... Later, Norm."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 408829, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 407362, "text": "- Well?\n- Well."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 410463, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 408996, "text": "Did you get the tickets?"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 412159, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 410965, "text": "Almost."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 416167, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 412333, "text": "Dan, no ticky, no Candy."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 419839, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 416938, "text": "Not to worry. I'm on it."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 424641, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 421843, "text": "Now what, Sydney? Now what?"}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 427708, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 425012, "text": "I'm sorry. Don't ever change.\nYou're marvelous. I love you."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 429281, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 427882, "text": "Get out of here."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 437581, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 436557, "text": "Yo."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 440728, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 438760, "text": "Your Honor."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 446029, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 443231, "text": "- Bail reports.\n- Thanks, Selma."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 450097, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446434, "text": "You weren't kidding\nwhen you said recess, were you?"}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 453466, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450838, "text": "Come on. Inside."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 455406, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 454041, "text": "- Brace yourself.\n- For what?"}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 458807, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 455576, "text": "I just caught Andy here\nsneaking out of the ladies' room."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 461810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 459580, "text": "Oh, Andy."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 465475, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 461983, "text": "Little curious\nabout the opposite sex, are we?"}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 469248, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465653, "text": "Harry, he is the opposite sex."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 474092, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 472727, "text": "He's what?"}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 475661, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 474262, "text": "He's a girl."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 479998, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 476130, "text": "Well, rope my feet and call me doggie."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 485867, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 484605, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 487200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 486040, "text": "I know."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 490867, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 487375, "text": "Yes, Mom, I know\nI've got some explaining to do."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 493446, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491979, "text": "Take a number."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 494979, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 493614, "text": "Bye."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 500320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497852, "text": "So how about that space shuttle, huh?"}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 501949, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 500755, "text": "We're waiting."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 505882, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 502390, "text": "None of the volunteer fathers' places\nwould take girls, so I faked them out."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 510019, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 506060, "text": "I thought you had to take a parent, go down\nthere and talk to the social workers."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 514157, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 510198, "text": "You do. I just found a bag lady\nat Penn Station and paid her to go with me."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 517967, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 514702, "text": "That's where smart people go shopping\nfor mothers."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 519933, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 518773, "text": "So..."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 521199, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 520107, "text": "...nice meeting you."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 522967, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 521375, "text": "- Where you going?\n- To get my books."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 526910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 523144, "text": "- I can wait for my mom out front.\n- Wait a minute. What about Bull?"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 530711, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 528049, "text": "- Just tell him I said I'm sorry.\n- You tell him."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 532216, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 530885, "text": "I can't. He'll be crushed."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 537187, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532386, "text": "He'll be crushed. He'll be devastated.\nHe'll fall on somebody."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 541828, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 538392, "text": "- I gotta go.\n- Get back here, sister."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 547024, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 543998, "text": "You may like the big galoot,\nbut I love him."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 550466, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 547201, "text": "And when he's depressed, he moans."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 554574, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 550638, "text": "Not loud, but low, like this:"}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 560311, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 557478, "text": "And I'm the only one\nwho can hear him when he does it."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 564611, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 560481, "text": "And I'm not gonna go\nthrough months of that for anybody."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 566446, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 564785, "text": "Sit down."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 568947, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567855, "text": "- Attaboy.\n- Girl."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 570818, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 569123, "text": "Whatever."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 586767, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 585072, "text": "Uh-uh."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 599144, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 597552, "text": "Yo."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 601579, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 600555, "text": "Hi, guys."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 605757, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 604358, "text": "Hi, Bull."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 608188, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 606561, "text": "- Bull.\nHey, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 612498, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 609597, "text": "You wanna kick Billie and Selma out\nso we can tell dirty jokes?"}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 614430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 612667, "text": "- We better wait...\n- I just heard one..."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 617093, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 614602, "text": "...about three Swedish nurses in a canoe."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 619068, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 617271, "text": "- Yeah...\n- How'd they get in the canoe?"}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 621003, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 619240, "text": "- It doesn't matter. Anyway...\n- Bull."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 623469, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 621842, "text": "Okay, later."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 626442, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 624679, "text": "Andy, I got you a present."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 630106, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 626614, "text": "The bigger they are, the harder they fall."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 631444, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 630284, "text": "Listen, Bull."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 632984, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 631619, "text": "Ta-da!"}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 635452, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 633154, "text": "Let's move some of the furniture back."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 639359, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 636390, "text": "Maybe tomorrow we can go out to the park\nand run a few plays."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 642690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 639527, "text": "You never know,\nthe kid could grow up and play pro ball."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 644763, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 642863, "text": "In East Germany maybe."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 647399, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 646000, "text": "Did I miss something?"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 649195, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 647568, "text": "I'm afraid so, Bull."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 651362, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 649770, "text": "You're on."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 656740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 654909, "text": "My name is Stella."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 662278, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660481, "text": "Kind of has a nice ring to it, right?"}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 665782, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 664485, "text": "Right."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 667443, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 665953, "text": "Bull."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 669179, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 668155, "text": "I'm a girl."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 673556, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 671759, "text": "Get out of here."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 676424, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 673728, "text": "Bull, it's true."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 690600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 688109, "text": "Timber."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 693004, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 691412, "text": "We've done it, now."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 695774, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 693180, "text": "Take it easy."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 699616, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 696317, "text": "- Sir, if this is one of your dumb jokes...\n- It is no joke, Bull."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 701812, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 699787, "text": "Billie saw her in the ladies' room."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 705983, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 702923, "text": "She is without."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 709220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 706160, "text": "But this can't be. I mean,\nI met you and your mom at Penn Station."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 713390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 709397, "text": "That wasn't my mom. She doesn't know\nI've been doing this. I've been lying to her."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 714932, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713567, "text": "I've been lying to everybody."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 719362, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 715369, "text": "- Why would you do a thing like that to me?\n- Because you went looking for a son."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 722839, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 719540, "text": "They all come looking for sons.\nAnd I thought when I met you that..."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 725103, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 723010, "text": "You know, you were so excited,\nand I thought..."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 726439, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 725279, "text": "What?"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 730414, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 726614, "text": "- That I looked like a pretty good chump?\n- Bull, please."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 732952, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 731052, "text": "Here, take it."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 735816, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 733120, "text": "Maybe you can dress it up like a doll."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 741925, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 738626, "text": "Hey, it's not as bad as all that."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 750170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 748202, "text": "There, did anybody hear that?"}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 752635, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 750337, "text": "Hey, what's Bull so upset about?"}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 755803, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 753107, "text": "Oh, we seem to have had a change\nin gender."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 762308, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 760681, "text": "Which one?"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 767344, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 764318, "text": "I think I know\nwhere that big ape is going."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 774584, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 773094, "text": "Bull?"}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 782264, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 780501, "text": "Bull."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 789572, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 787775, "text": "Bull!"}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 798084, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 796150, "text": "Don't ever do that again."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 802648, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 800020, "text": "Why does it always happen to me?"}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 807891, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 803124, "text": "I don't know, Bull.\nCouldn't we go someplace more down?"}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 812325, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 808696, "text": "All the time we spent,\nall the stuff we did..."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 814968, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 812500, "text": "...I never had any idea."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 817568, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 815236, "text": "Bull, you only met her today."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 821367, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 817738, "text": "You can't know anybody really well\nunless you spend a lot of time together..."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 824204, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821542, "text": "...or, you know,\nyou go through something traumatic."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 833043, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 831018, "text": "- My hand.\n- What?"}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 837987, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 833220, "text": "My hand. Take my damn hand."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 847228, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 844532, "text": "<i>I'll never see Vertigo again.</i>"}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 850297, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 847601, "text": "Your Honor, if you don't mind,\nI'd like to be alone."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 852405, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 850471, "text": "This is my private spot."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 856065, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 852573, "text": "I got an idea. Let's hit the cafeteria.\nThey got food. They got hot coffee."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 857835, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 856243, "text": "They got a ceiling."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 859639, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 858012, "text": "I'd stay here, sir."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 861839, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 859814, "text": "It's so peaceful."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 864246, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862016, "text": "A man can think."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 868450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 865686, "text": "What's that up there?"}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 875855, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 871759, "text": "Maybe you better come back here\nfor humanitarian reasons, huh?"}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 878924, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876831, "text": "If you're gonna lecture me,\nget it over with."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 880828, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 879099, "text": "I'm not gonna lecture you, Bull."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 886028, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882069, "text": "Okay, but it's a real short one.\nNow, when I saw you two together..."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 888971, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 886207, "text": "...I could tell that you were real happy\nwith each other."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 891839, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 889143, "text": "- It's just not the same anymore.\n- Well, it is for her."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 893604, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892012, "text": "She needs a father in her life."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 896443, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 893781, "text": "Wasn't it pretty obvious\nhow much it meant to her?"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 899211, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 896617, "text": "I don't know anything about girls,\nYour Honor."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 902783, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899620, "text": "They don't do the same stuff boys do."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 908050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 904091, "text": "They always make those little circles\nover the I's when they write letters."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 912464, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 909597, "text": "They go to the bathroom in groups."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 915301, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 913868, "text": "And they have..."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 916868, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 915469, "text": "You know, they have..."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 918800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 917037, "text": "- Peaks and valleys?\n- Thank you."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 924172, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 918973, "text": "Yeah. And sometimes they get a raw deal\nout of life just like boys do."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 929647, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 926780, "text": "I just can't do the same things\nwith her, Harry."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 933847, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930150, "text": "Come on,\nthat's not the important stuff, Bull."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 940218, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 935155, "text": "<i>Above the earth is stretched the sky\nNo higher than the soul is high</i>"}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 946390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 940394, "text": "<i>The earth stands out from side to side\nNo wider than the heart is wide</i>"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 952337, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 948936, "text": "We were gonna write our names\nin the snow."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 956037, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 952806, "text": "That you would have to give up, yeah."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 973986, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 971859, "text": "Candy? That you, honey?"}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 976652, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 974161, "text": "No, dear, it's just me."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 979555, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 978065, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 987065, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 984471, "text": "You really feel that bad about the game?"}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 989166, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 988108, "text": "Ah!"}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 993408, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 990678, "text": "No, don't bother getting up.\nI'm sure it's nothing."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 995275, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 993580, "text": "Listen."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 997416, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 995482, "text": "You want those tickets,\nyou can have them."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 999612, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 997985, "text": "Really?"}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1002316, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1000587, "text": "That's great, Mac."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1004957, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1002489, "text": "Thank you so much. What a pal."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1007593, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1005159, "text": "- I gonna have to charge you.\n- Yes, indeed, of course."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1011458, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1007761, "text": "Danny would not expect a freebie,\nnot for something this big."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1013497, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1011632, "text": "No way. Okay, how much?"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1015567, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1013667, "text": "A thousand dollars."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1021163, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1017705, "text": "- A thousand dollars?\n- Grandpa really wanted to see that game."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1024140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1021342, "text": "A thousand American dollars?"}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1026472, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1024311, "text": "Course, if you found tickets\nsomeplace else..."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1027944, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1026647, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1031342, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029750, "text": "I'll pay it."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1037883, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1036256, "text": "- That was...\n- A thousand."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1041425, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038058, "text": "Yeah, yeah. Just checking."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1051661, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1049670, "text": "You have a good time, now, you hear?"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1053136, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1051839, "text": "You bet I will."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1057835, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1053307, "text": "Row 107. That's kind of high, isn't it?"}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1060373, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1058178, "text": "I've got binoculars\nin my desk if you want them."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1062811, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1060547, "text": "- Hey, that's great. Thanks.\n- Ten dollars."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1067277, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1065252, "text": "- Say what?\n- To rent the binoculars."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1069285, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1067454, "text": "You have got to be kidding."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1073187, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1069456, "text": "Oh, but there's a sale over at the\nsporting-goods store right across the street."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1076955, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1073360, "text": "You can pick up a pair just like mine\nfor $89.95."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1089806, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1086473, "text": "So you want the parking pass,\nor you gonna take her on the bus?"}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1099183, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1094314, "text": "Mom's been dating now and then, but if\nthey're single, they're creeps or they're dull."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1101685, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1099353, "text": "- Tell me about it.\n- Tell me about it."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1105822, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1103991, "text": "- How's Bull?\n- Well, we talked."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1107324, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1105993, "text": "He hates me, right?"}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1110088, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1107494, "text": "Actually, I don't think it's in Bull\nto hate anyone."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1113358, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1110264, "text": "Though I am filling him in\non Barry Manilow."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1117336, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1115436, "text": "- Honey?\n- Oh, hi, Mom."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1119938, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1117504, "text": "What's going on?\nAre you in some kind of trouble?"}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1123406, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1120107, "text": "- What on earth have you done to your hair?\n- I'm Judge Stone."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1126375, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1123577, "text": "Hello. I've got 32 more questions."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1129516, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1126547, "text": "Do any of them involve your girl\npretending to be a boy?"}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1132816, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1130951, "text": "Thirty-three."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1135849, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1133654, "text": "Mom, I got a volunteer father."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1137115, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1136023, "text": "I beg your pardon?"}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1139125, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1137658, "text": "I got a father."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1142558, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1139293, "text": "We played basketball in the park,\nand he helped me with my homework."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1143718, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1142729, "text": "Uh."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1147731, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1143897, "text": "- Are you okay?\n- I have this problem with sudden shocks."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1150927, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1148902, "text": "There he is, Ma."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1155639, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1153774, "text": "Good example."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1159174, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1157411, "text": "Bull, wait."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1166511, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1164384, "text": "I just wanted to say goodbye."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1170780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1167788, "text": "That's okay. I understand."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1174092, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1171191, "text": "It's like buying something\nand discovering when you get home..."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1177094, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1174261, "text": "...that they put the wrong thing in the box,\nisn't it?"}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1180498, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1178132, "text": "Hey, I'd be upset too."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1183634, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1182269, "text": "Here."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1193269, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1190744, "text": "Hope whoever you get likes football."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1199609, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1198585, "text": "Let's go, Mom."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1204485, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199786, "text": "Well, listen, I'd like to apologize\nif any of this has been an inconvenience."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1208492, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1204658, "text": "Of course,\nI don't know what any of this is."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1210022, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1208896, "text": "It's no problem."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1213325, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1210197, "text": "In fact, we kind of liked\nhaving Andy around."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1217095, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213500, "text": "- Andy?\n- It was either that or Opie."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1220837, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1219540, "text": "Well, goodbye."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1222635, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1221008, "text": "- See you, kid.\n- Bye, kid."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1227342, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1225112, "text": "Stella!"}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1232243, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1229183, "text": "Let Brando top that."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1235250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1233020, "text": "- What?\n- Move your butt."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1244422, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1240861, "text": "I reacted when I found out\nyou were a girl because..."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1246431, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1245032, "text": "...l'm warped."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1249835, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1247401, "text": "- Oh, my God.\n- It's all right."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1251470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1250003, "text": "He doesn't mean what he says."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1254069, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1252306, "text": "Bull, I was gonna tell you, I swear."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1258007, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1254241, "text": "I mean, we would have gone swimming.\nIt would have been hard to explain my suit."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1260043, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1258178, "text": "- Shut up.\n- Yes, sir."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1266419, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1264451, "text": "I went funny in the head..."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1271718, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1269022, "text": "...because all I'd been thinking about\nwas myself."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1275486, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1273427, "text": "How I'd act with a son."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1279063, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1275662, "text": "How I'd be the envy of all the guys\nwho didn't have one."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1282969, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1281001, "text": "How I'd feel good\nwhen we were together."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1287307, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1285339, "text": "Somewhere along the way..."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1290671, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1287474, "text": "...I forgot all about the kid\nI was supposed to be helping."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1295809, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1291645, "text": "- But you wanted a son.\n- I wanted someone to take care of."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1301510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1296550, "text": "I know now it doesn't matter\nif that someone is a boy or a girl..."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1303718, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1301955, "text": "...or a toad."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1309284, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1305325, "text": "So is that someone\nanywhere around here?"}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1312331, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1309863, "text": "She couldn't be any closer."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1321734, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1317638, "text": "If he hadn't said \"toad,\" I'd be in tears."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1334847, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1332686, "text": "- Great news.\n- Great news. You first."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1338480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1335022, "text": "My brother went to school with one\nof the Jets, and he got me a field pass."}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1340957, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1338659, "text": "- What's yours?\n- I'm gonna go buy a big shovel..."}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1344120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1341128, "text": "...and beat myself in the head\nuntil I'm bloody."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1360207, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1358512, "text": "Deal."}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1364378, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1363116, "text": "Yo."}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1365745, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1364551, "text": "Company."}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1368285, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1365919, "text": "Hey, come on in.\nLook at that."}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1369479, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1368455, "text": "Isn't she cute?"}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1371214, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1369656, "text": "Pretty.\nLook at that."}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1374053, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1371391, "text": "Boy in a dress, big deal."}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1376890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1374695, "text": "- What's up?\n- We're going to the opera tonight."}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1379225, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1377064, "text": "- Oh, that's great, Bull, really.\nThat's sweet."}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1382334, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1379399, "text": "Getting late. Gotta change.\nSee you later."}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1384527, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1382502, "text": "Yeah, you kids have fun, now."}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1386696, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1384705, "text": "Wow, four of a kind."}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1388135, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1386873, "text": "Good luck, Fielding."}
